<!doctype html><html lang="en-CA"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Donate | PictureThis Production</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"/></head><body><a href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="masthead"><a href="/"><b>PICTURETHIS PRODUCTION</b></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/programs/">Programs</a><a href="/faithfire/">Faithfire</a><a href="/projects/">Projects</a><a href="/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/events/">Events</a><a href="/partners/">Partners</a><a class="nav-action" href="/get-involved/">Get Involved</a><a href="/donate/">Donate</a></nav></header><main id="main"><section class="page-opening"><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/28643185.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Sound engineer operating an outdoor mixing console" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><h2>Donate</h2><p></p></section><section class="giving"><ul><li><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/4330788.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Audio cables and connectors stored on shelving" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><strong class="amount">$40</strong> covers one participant's course materials for the full eight weeks.</li><li><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/8412361.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Two camera operators working beside production cameras" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><strong class="amount">$90</strong> covers a term of transit stipends so a participant can actually get to training.</li><li><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/34623187.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Engineer working at an illuminated control desk" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><strong class="amount">$250</strong> goes to the gear library: the shared kit participants learn on and borrow for first calls.</li><li><figure class="production-photo"><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/11410604.jpeg?h=900&w=1600" alt="Production crew preparing equipment backstage" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure><strong class="amount">Monthly partners</strong> keep the program free for the next cohort. Every amount is reported in our annual update: what came in, what it bought, who it trained.</li></ul><a href={"mailto:"+contactEmail}>{contactEmail}</a></section></main><footer><p>Training: Faithfire Production, 139 Millwick Dr, Toronto.</p><p>PictureThis Production is being set up as a nonprofit organization in Ontario.</p><p>Faithfire Production is its production arm.</p><a href="/policies/">Our standards & policies</a> · <a href={"mailto:"+contactEmail}>{contactEmail}</a> · Placeholder contact</footer><script>document.querySelectorAll("header nav a").forEach(a=>{if(a.getAttribute("href")===location.pathname)a.setAttribute("aria-current","page")})</script></body></html>